omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ivgtp4_9KqoQ7kNvwHH0Cp6&_nc_oc=Ado-oNbu79DDm_FaZaYmlaqcVQxdolFMdzXvHi09RUF5bS_jw2noc9C2eVm92E5yS8Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfxkowuXndqAQT54-MSeCngwl9n-qrHupTnEQr8Fr6z0_Q&oe=69CBAE74"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tCsQrXTA9AoQ7kNvwHzSrtq&_nc_oc=AdoMprAdk5gZDiBeAq6PKYKVZ-seXjgk4ueg5T-VexzvQgkyeWlQYM_87Icq_CIJMiU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afyx9qk4IUruYdVXXcOoz0Ra12hYshI5WgFpDMScFcHl7w&oe=69CBAFD6"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=o_175YN9VqoQ7kNvwF8Yzti&_nc_oc=AdrXr8VurFfwpJu_VmqVOqQWQH7CKroHM7qOJVnxcWLfYF0rcOk8bkBIVy_Wt804gcI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfzV77UJSWG2eu5vI0kl2eXb1dPA963HPJzxLQpMPEwGmw&oe=69CBC4F7"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://